<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n99853" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνειλ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>crowd together</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τέκνα καὶ τὰς γυναῖκας ἐς τοὺς
					νεωσοίκους συνειλήσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.45
				</span></i>
			; also of things, <i>bind together</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥάβδους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.67
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be crowded</i> or <i>pressed together</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἔλαττον</span> into less
			compass, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				7.2.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ τὸν ναόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					5.3.1
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				60
			</span></i> (so <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαυτὸν συνειλήσας</span>, of
			the hedgehog, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				6.64
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροφὴ συνειληθεῖσα</span>
			<i>compressed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				3.14.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύστις ς. εἰς ἑωυτήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SD</u>
					1.7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς κυκεῶνα πάντα συνειλέονται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Vit.Auct.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ἀπορίᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					7.304
				</span></i>
			.</div>
